Twemoji font for emoji-components

The font files (dist/*.woff2, dist/Twemoji.ttf) are built from the SVG
graphics of Twemoji (https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji), Copyright 2019
Twitter, Inc and other contributors, licensed under CC-BY 4.0 (see LICENSE,
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Changes from the original graphics: converted to COLRv0 glyphs with nanoemoji,
non-square artwork centered in a square em box, split into unicode-range
subsets for the web font. Twitter and the Twemoji contributors do not endorse
this package.

